{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时不去想两个人的未来，只想舒服地待在这份亲近里。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、陶醉、安静、漂浮\",\n      \"missed\": \"他其实还想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这种相处，也想确认对方是否有同样的感觉，但还没想好怎么开口，念头就淡了。这层欲言又止需要读第二段才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他享受着两个人的亲近，忽然想说出自己的喜欢，但话还没说出口，念头又缩了回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、陶醉、犹豫、受牵绊\",\n      \"missed\": \"具体想表达的是多喜欢这样待着，以及想问对方是不是也一样；末尾的思绪难以拼凑、无法解开的结仍然比较抽象，需要结合上下文理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他享受着两个人的亲近，想表达喜欢、确认对方的心意，却又把话咽了回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、陶醉、犹豫、牵绊、难以言说\",\n      \"missed\": \"想说的话具体是什么、为什么最终没有说出来，仍需要读第二段；末尾几个抽象短语之间的区别和关系也不容易一眼理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段长句同样醒目，第一眼没有特别明确的优先入口，关键的欲言又止埋在第二段里。下方短语虽然补充了动作和情绪，但同色平铺、条数较多，尤其“受了牵绊、思绪难以拼凑、无法解开的结”与具体处境的关系不够直观。文字里的亲近、舒适和想说又收回，整体能够串成一回事；但下半部分的金色点线动画比较抽象，没有提供能进一步连接人物处境的具体画面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "288ac378-d24a-4f74-b22b-919cf86c7a78", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002649575521Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:28:31.820138+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "040635eee95c3cc40df99fc4281428d7628072964dc70c008756689742e796af", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002649575521Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fffd6a894f3c22f2e2be57ed546a7a92e3ae3c7f03af663f87b01d7943c96571"}}}
